  "statement_html": "<div class=\"euler_quest\">\tOn donne trois descriptions de triangle \\(\\text{RIZ}\\) et trois égalités.\t<div class=\"spacer quest\">Pour chacun des cas suivants, sélectionner le sommet qui permet d'associer à l'égalité de Pythagore donnée le triangle rectangle correspondant.</div>\t</div>\t<div class=\"wims_scrollable\">\t<table class=\"tab_sol\">\t  <tr>\t    <th >&#201;galité</th>\t    <th>Le triangle \\(\\text{RIZ}\\) est rectangle en</th>\t  </tr>\t   <tr>\t     <th scope=\"row\">\\(Z R^{2} + Z I^{2} = R I^{2}\\)</th>\t      <td>\t        <fieldset class=\"euler_field\">\t         <legend> </legend>\t        <ul class=\"wims_nopuce euler_ul_check\">\t           <li >\t            <span class=\"oef-radio-inline\" name=\"reply1\" data-value=\"1\" data-content=\"\\(\\mathrm{R}\\)\"></span>                     </li> <li >\t            <span class=\"oef-radio-inline\" name=\"reply1\" data-value=\"2\" data-content=\"\\(\\mathrm{I}\\)\"></span>                     </li> <li >\t            <span class=\"oef-radio-inline\" name=\"reply1\" data-value=\"3\" data-content=\"\\(\\mathrm{Z}\\)\"></span>                     </li>         </ul>\t        </fieldset>\t      </td>\t    </tr>\t    <tr>\t     <th scope=\"row\">\\(I Z^{2} = R I^{2} + R Z^{2}\\)</th>\t      <td>\t        <fieldset class=\"euler_field\">\t         <legend> </legend>\t        <ul class=\"wims_nopuce euler_ul_check\">\t           <li >\t            <span class=\"oef-radio-inline\" name=\"reply2\" data-value=\"1\" data-content=\"\\(\\mathrm{R}\\)\"></span>                     </li> <li >\t            <span class=\"oef-radio-inline\" name=\"reply2\" data-value=\"2\" data-content=\"\\(\\mathrm{I}\\)\"></span>                     </li> <li >\t            <span class=\"oef-radio-inline\" name=\"reply2\" data-value=\"3\" data-content=\"\\(\\mathrm{Z}\\)\"></span>                     </li>         </ul>\t        </fieldset>\t      </td>\t    </tr>\t    <tr>\t     <th scope=\"row\">\\(R Z^